# Ephemeral in-gate strings-file extraction (#198): the gate produces
# `prompts-<version>.json` into a prompt-data-cache for the run only — never
# committed here or to a leaf (cockpit rule; the leaf's data/prompts stays skrabe's).
prompts-*.json
prompt-data-cache/
